\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363910/extras/8de25c252a579551f287a8a6b3f7be43.mp4?t=1775234926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ŕ̶͙ǔ̴̩n̶̜͊.̶̯͋</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>H̴͚̭̉͗ị̴̗̓͂͗d̵̨̘̟͗̍ě̸̲͉̯</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>D̴̲͆̎I̶̧̤̻͎̗͓̒E̵͎̱̳͋͗̒̂̑</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "You Have Been Deleted is a first-person survival horror inspired by the early internet and the 90s, all packaged in a surreal retro art style. Trapped within a corrupted virtual reality made by the company you work for, you must Uncover, Hack, and Survive if you ever wish to free yourself from hell.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363910/ab8dc24f764e3087fe5edbaeeed66f8818d2ba97/header.jpg?t=1775234926", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363910/6c4fd40e63a367ed397d5c641533d9124b4ca6e7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775234926", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3363910/6c4fd40e63a367ed397d5c641533d9124b4ca6e7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775234926", "website": "http://ehlersvideo.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> TBD MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> TBD MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> TBD<br></l